        {
          "text": "oyu Ezara wakainka kuzwa ku-Babuloni, Kali mulembi uucenjede wa-Mulao wa-Musa, Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli ngwaakapede. Nkabela mwami wakamupa zyoonse nzyaakakumbila kujanza lya-Jehova Leza wakwe ilyakali alinguwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
