            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo watumwa kuzwa kumwami akuzwa kulibasinkuta bakwe bali musanu ababili kukulingula makani aa-Juda a-Jerusalemu, mbubonya mbuli mulao wa-Leza wako uuli mujanza lyako, ",
