          "text": "ansiliva angolida zyoonse nzyoti jane mucisi coonse ca-Babuloni, antoomwe azipo zyabantu azyabapaizi, myoyo yabo nziiyanda kupa iŋanda ya-Leza wabo yaku-Jerusalemu, ",
