        {
          "text": "Ndime mwami Aritasasta, Ndalailila boonse basiziyobwedo bali kutala lyamulonga kuti, kufumbwa ncakumbila Ezara mupaizi, mulembi wamulao wa-Leza wakujulu, amufwambaane kucicita, ",
