        {
          "text": "Ayebo O Ezara, mbuli mbojisi busongo bwa-Leza mumaanza aako, bika babetesi abasinkuta kuti babeteke bantu boonse bali kutala lyamulonga, boonse babwene milao ya-Leza wako. Abaabo batabwene, kobaiisya. ",
          "type": "text",
